      <div class="svc-body">
        <div class="svc-label">Service 04</div>
        <div class="svc-name">Parts, Spares &amp;<br><span class="accent">Ongoing Support</span></div>
        <p class="svc-desc">Industrial equipment is expected to operate reliably long after installation, and effective after-sales support plays a critical role in maintaining plant performance and minimizing downtime. Because Jayveecons engineers and manufactures the equipment we supply, we maintain complete access to original drawings, material specifications, manufacturing data, and application knowledge — enabling faster support, accurate replacement parts, and long-term service continuity.</p>
        <p class="svc-desc">We provide ongoing spare parts and support services for VECTOMEC™ equipment across conveying, processing, storage, and thermal systems, while also supporting selected third-party equipment where specifications and manufacturing requirements align with our capabilities. Our focus is not only on replacing worn components, but on helping clients improve equipment reliability, maintenance planning, and operational uptime over the long term. </p>
        <div class="svc-points">
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>OEM replacement parts:</strong><br>Original-specification replacement parts manufactured from existing engineering drawings and production data for Jayveecons-supplied equipment.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>Spare &amp; Consumables:</strong><br> Supply and fabrication of high-wear components including conveyor belts, screw flights, elevator buckets, liners, rollers, and other regularly replaced operating parts.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>3rd Party Equipment Support:</strong> <br> Reverse engineering and manufacture of replacement components for compatible third-party equipment where specifications can be accurately matched.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>Emergency Breakdown Support:</strong> <br> Priority fabrication and expedited support for critical breakdown situations where downtime directly impacts plant operations and production schedules.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>Maintenance Support:</strong><br> Assistance in establishing recommended spare parts inventories and shutdown planning programs to support preventive maintenance and faster recovery during outages.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>Performance & Upgrade Components:</strong> <br> Improved-specification replacement parts developed to address recurring wear, operational inefficiencies, material changes, or demanding service conditions.</div></div>
        </div>
        <a href="/contact?service=parts" class="svc-cta">Order parts or discuss spares strategy <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SERVICE 5 — dark navy -->
