        <div class="svc-name">Restoring Performance &amp;<br><span class="accent"> Extending Service Life.</span></div>
        <p class="svc-desc">Not every operational issue requires complete equipment replacement. Jayveecons provides repair, refurbishment, and upgrade services for bulk material handling and process equipment, helping clients restore performance, extend equipment life, reduce downtime, and improve reliability while maximizing the value of existing assets.</p>
        <p class="svc-desc">Our teams support both Jayveecons-supplied systems and selected third-party equipment across conveying, thermal processing, storage, and material handling applications. Depending on the condition and operational requirements, services may range from targeted component repair and shutdown maintenance to complete equipment rebuilds and performance upgrades. </p>
        <div class="svc-points">
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>Assessment:</strong><br> Site inspections, equipment condition evaluation, failure analysis, and repair-versus-replacement recommendations based on operational, technical, and cost considerations.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>Workshop Repairs:</strong> <br> Shaft rebuilding, bearing housing restoration, pulley refurbishment, re-lagging, structural repair, welding correction, component replacement, and precision re-machining.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>On-site Repairs:</strong><br> Field repairs, emergency breakdown support, shutdown maintenance, alignment correction, welding, and servicing for equipment that cannot be removed from site.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>Equipment Rebuild:</strong><br> Complete dismantling, inspection, repair, replacement of worn components, reassembly, and restoration of equipment to reliable operating condition.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>Performance Upgrades:</strong><br> Capacity improvements, wear-life enhancements, material upgrades, drive modifications, automation integration, and operational improvements incorporated during refurbishment.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-point"><div class="svc-point-bullet"></div><div class="svc-point-text"><strong>VSK Refurbishment:</strong><br> Specialist refurbishment services for Vertical Shaft Kiln systems including refractory relining, grate replacement, shell repairs, thermal component restoration, and structural rehabilitation.</div></div>
        </div>
        <a href="/contact?service=repairs" class="svc-cta">Request a repair or refurbishment assessment <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
